---
import DemoBackdrop from "./DemoBackdrop.astro";
import DemoFrame from "./DemoFrame.astro";
---

<section
  class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 border-y border-stone-200 md:grid-cols-2"
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 bg-white px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:border-r md:border-stone-200 md:px-10 md:py-16 lg:px-16"
  >
    <p
      class="text-primary font-mono text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.56px] uppercase"
    >
      Human in the loop
    </p>
    <h2
      class="max-w-100.5 text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium sm:text-[32px]"
    >
      Seamlessly transition from <br class="hidden sm:inline" />AI to human
      expertise.
    </h2>
    <p class="max-w-lg text-base leading-5.5 font-normal text-stone-500">
      Ensure no customer request goes unanswered. When inquiries become complex,
      the AI agent flags and hands off the conversation to your team, ensuring a
      seamless customer experience.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://app.padyna.com"
      class="bg-primary mt-2 box-border flex h-8 w-fit cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-md px-4 py-1.5 text-center font-mono text-sm leading-5 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white uppercase transition-all duration-75 ease-in select-none active:scale-95 active:shadow-none"
      translate="no"
    >
      Onboard your team
    </a>
  </div>

  <figure
    class="relative m-0 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:py-16"
  >
    <DemoBackdrop />
    <DemoFrame
      src="/demos/escalation.html"
      width={400}
      height={640}
      title="Padyna chat widget escalating a conversation to a human agent"
      autoplay
      class="aspect-5/8 w-full max-w-100 rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white shadow-[0_24px_60px_-20px_rgb(28_25_23/0.35)]"
    />
    <figcaption class="sr-only">
      A customer asks the website chat widget for a refund. The AI agent
      escalates the conversation to a human, the widget shows that it is waiting
      for a human agent, then a teammate from billing joins live, confirms the
      refund, and the customer thanks them.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
